msgid ""
"This file contains the message of an in-progress annotated tag. If `git tag` "
"exits due to an error before creating an annotated tag then the tag message "
"that has been provided by the user in an editor session will be available in "
"this file, but may be overwritten by the next invocation of `git tag`."
